Wait, the overlay has `tabindex="-1"` which is excluded by the selector. Good.

So visible focusable elements in the modal:
1. #modal-close (button)
2. #filename (input)
3. #upload (button)

The retry button is hidden (display:none) so it will be filtered out.

Now when tabbing from #upload (index 2, last), the wrap will trigger and go to #modal-close (index 0).

This should fix the issue.

